WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.620
In Settings, set your medication, dose,
and shot day,

00:05.020 --> 00:07.340
So Today counts down to your next shot.

00:07.740 --> 00:13.020
Set your goals too: water, protein, and
movement, and your goal weight.

00:13.740 --> 00:16.240
Turn on Companion Memory here in Settings,

00:16.620 --> 00:19.780
So your Companion remembers your goals and
your shot day.

00:20.460 --> 00:22.280
Changes save as you type.

00:22.860 --> 00:25.360
Set it once, and the app does the rest.

